DESCRIPTION = "Normalizes each numbered clue of the puzzle's own text into one structured constraint fact (fixed house, not-in-house, adjacency, ordering, distance, equality, inequality). Adds no outside information and stays silent when a clue cannot be parsed unambiguously."

